  m_Name: runic
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PrincesPalace.Core::PrincesPalace.Content.ModifierDefinition
  id: runic
  displayName: Runic
  description: A deeper well of mana, a faster trickle, a cheaper follow-up cast,
    and nothing wasted -- unspent mana becomes a ward at the top of the wearer's
    own turn. The ward conversion is intentionally the WEAK half of this modifier
    (see FightTuning.RunicWardConversionRate's own comment) -- the mana pool and
    regen bonuses, and the mana-discount tempo rider, are Runic's real payoff; the
    ward is a safety net for mana a caster was going to leave on the table anyway,
    not a build-around tank strategy.
